{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o155","title":"马超反，劫贾洪将诣华阴使作露布，洪不获已为作之；司徒钟繇在东识其文曰此贾洪作也","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-df46980dabef2340bf2b","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"马超反，劫贾洪将诣华阴使作露布，洪不获已为作之；司徒钟繇在东识其文曰此贾洪作也","evidence":["zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-c5b12f6510a0634701eb","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"马超破走后太祖召贾洪署军谋掾，犹以其前为超作露布文故不即叙，晚乃出为阴泉长","evidence":["zhonghua-q-564df570b6237f0e22b4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"劫洪使作露布者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90"]},{"person":"zhonghua-p0074","role":"被迫作露布者；被召署而不即叙者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90","zhonghua-q-564df570b6237f0e22b4"]},{"person":"wudi-p0181","role":"识其文者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"召署军谋掾者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-564df570b6237f0e22b4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90","zhonghua-q-564df570b6237f0e22b4"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90","source_order":[13,517,97],"order":2936}],"persons":[{"id":"zhonghua-p0074","name":"贾洪","evidence":["zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90","zhonghua-q-564df570b6237f0e22b4","zhonghua-q2-7f6ce7b25b0d3b5592ec"],"facts":[{"id":"zhonghua-f2-7116bc3f700984dda346","text":"贾洪建安初举计掾，应州辟，历守三县令并授诸生；后为阴泉长，延康中转白马王相，数岁病亡，五十余岁。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-7f6ce7b25b0d3b5592ec"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-564df570b6237f0e22b4","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-396ef784c999b05fc71f","layer":"pei","quote":"及超破走，太祖召洪署军谋掾。犹以其前为超作露布文，故不即叙。晚乃出为阴泉长。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":516,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-29aaab3281d7871e6af5","start":146,"end":184,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-c5aacc29f7fff79dbd90","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-396ef784c999b05fc71f","layer":"pei","quote":"后马超反，超劫洪，将诣华阴，使作露布；洪不获已，为作之。司徒钟繇在东，识其文，曰：‘此贾洪作也！’","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":516,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-29aaab3281d7871e6af5","start":97,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q2-7f6ce7b25b0d3b5592ec","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-396ef784c999b05fc71f","layer":"pei","quote":"“贾洪字叔业，京兆新丰人也。好学有才，而特精于《春秋左传》。建安初，仕郡，举计掾。应州辟，时州中自参军事以下百余人，唯洪与冯翊严苞（交）〔文〕通才学最高。洪历守三县令，所在辄开除厩舍，亲授诸生。后马超反，超劫洪，将诣华阴，使作露布；洪不获已，为作之。司徒钟繇在东，识其文，曰：‘此贾洪作也！’及超破走，太祖召洪署军谋掾。犹以其前为超作露布文，故不即叙。晚乃出为阴泉长。延康中，转为白马王相，善能谈戏。王彪，亦雅好文学，常师宗之，过于三卿。数岁，病亡，亡时年五十余。时人为之恨仕不至二千石。而严苞亦历守二县。黄初中，以高才入为秘书丞。数奏文赋，文帝异之。出为西平太守，卒官。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":516,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-29aaab3281d7871e6af5","start":0,"end":287,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
